 "_about": [
  "Lanes: the subjects worth posting about (science, space, nature, markets, medical, tech, history).",
  "A topic gets the first lane whose words match it (topic text plus its headline). Words are matched as whole words, case-insensitive;",
  "a trailing * means 'starts with' (archaeolog* matches archaeology, archaeologist, archaeological).",
  "block: topics never put in a lane, even when a word matches (games, cartoons, films that share a word).",
  "skip: a headline containing any of these words is never put in a lane (war, crime, politics and sport share many words with science).",
  "skip_ignores: lanes whose words are specific enough to win even when a skip word is present (an earthquake in Russia is still an earthquake).",
  "feeds: extra RSS/Atom feeds fetched every run, each tagged with its lane; country is '' for worldwide. Add or remove freely."
 ],
